    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I think I'll go with something comfortable and a bit casual, like jeans or a T-shirt. It's good to wear clothes that make me feel confident.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T09:06:06.340561+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, really? That's interesting. Do you like jeans or T-shirts? Maybe we should pick something that fits both of us well.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T09:06:43.613992+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I think I'll go with something more comfortable, like a T-shirt. It's important to feel confident and relaxed in such a private setting.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T09:08:34.199816+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I can see how that would be comfortable for you. But, I think jeans are a bit more casual too, and I'm really feeling like my legs could use some support today.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T09:09:18.095910+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm glad to hear that! I appreciate your consideration.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T09:10:06.278019+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you so much for the suggestion. I'm really feeling like my legs could use some support today.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T09:11:32.515780+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thank you so much for the suggestion! It means a lot to hear that I can help support my legs today. If there's anything else I can do, feel free to let me know.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T09:13:04.485484+00:00"
